The [[Belladonna's Whisper]] is a [[Ranger]] [[Weapon]] normally obtained by combining the [[Bow and Arrow]] with a [[Pestilence Flask]]. It is a clear upgrade for the [[Bow and Arrow]], dealing substantially more damage, and inflicting {{icon/poison}} proportional to the damage the {{icon/star}} weapon at its tip deals. It also deals more damage the more {{icon/poison}} the opponent has.

The [[Belladonna's Whisper]] likely has the strongest upside of any of the [[Bow and Arrow]] (or even [[Shortbow]]) upgrades, since it inflicts uncapped amounts of {{icon/poison}}, and could probably outdo any other source of {{icon/poison}}, so long as the {{icon/star}} weapon damage is high enough. With high amounts of {{icon/poison}} inflicted, the [[Belladonna's Whisper]] would deal extremely high ranged damage as well. 

The [[Skill]] [[Critical Poison]] is very similar to the Whisper and can pair well with it as a result.
